  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outgoing mission Harvest Money Expo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Dutch participation at the following three Harvest Money Expo fairs (2020-2022). Transfer of Dutch technology, skills and knowledge will be essential in this project. This goal should be achieved by setting up decent workshops, seminars and demonstrations at the fairs and aligning well with other initiatives supported by the Netherlands Embassy in Kampala, Uganda, and RVO. There will be a big Holland village at the well-attended fair with Dutch companies from the Netherlands, Dutch companies from the East African Community (EAC) and Ugandan farmers that participate and have participated in the Best Farmer competition.</narrative>
  </description>
